1. Install XAMP
2. Change htdocs path to you repo htpath
3. Export db sql dump (full, with db creation) from phpmyadmin
4. Download phpunit (https://phpunit.de/getting-started/phpunit-11.html), place in C:\xampp
5. Run test via  `php phpunit-11.5.55.phar C:\Users\legusie\Documents\GitHub\phppg\htdocs`
